Package: hd-repo
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Erik Van Hamme <erik.vanhamme@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: nginx, gnupg, apt-utils, passwd
Recommends: openssh-server
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: HyprDebian package repository
 Hosts the signed hyprdebian package repository for the suites trixie and
 unstable, and serves it over HTTP with nginx from /srv/hd-repo.
 .
 The user repo uploads packages with scp to /var/lib/hd-repo/inbox/<suite>
 and runs hd-repo-update, which moves them into the pool, makes the indices
 and signs them with the key in /etc/hyprdebian/hd-repo/gnupg. The key is
 generated on the first installation. When /srv/hd-repo is a ZFS dataset,
 every update that adds packages takes a snapshot first.
